# Release 1B — Round 19 Checksums
# Non-recursive integrity design:
#   - This file covers all other Round 19 artifacts.
#   - This file does NOT contain its own hash (non-recursive by design).
#   - Its external hash must be recorded by the operator after download.
#
# OPERATOR INSTRUCTIONS:
#   Run from the release1b_round19/ directory:
#     shasum -a 256 <filename>
#     wc -c < <filename>
#   Fill in the SHA256 and BYTES columns below.
#   Compare against values stated by the tool environment at delivery.
#
# R18 authoritative values (for cross-reference):
#   release1b_round18/release1b_round18_checksums.sha256
#   SHA-256: 5befdb6d0030a0c1465ed72bc227ebde2d027afe7641f9b48477fcbf3a7e1a47
#   Bytes:   1252
#
# Format: SHA256  BYTES  FILENAME

OPERATOR-COMPUTES  OPERATOR-COMPUTES  release1b_cp0.zsh
OPERATOR-COMPUTES  OPERATOR-COMPUTES  release1b_cp0_manifest.json
OPERATOR-COMPUTES  OPERATOR-COMPUTES  release1b_schema_manifest.json
OPERATOR-COMPUTES  OPERATOR-COMPUTES  release1b_hook_manifest.json
OPERATOR-COMPUTES  OPERATOR-COMPUTES  release1b_test_manifest.json
OPERATOR-COMPUTES  OPERATOR-COMPUTES  release1b_operator_instructions.md
OPERATOR-COMPUTES  OPERATOR-COMPUTES  release1b_round19_review.md

